{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 6, "ref": "1-kings 20:6", "book": "1-kings", "lang": "nl", "chapter": 20, "translation": "maar ⟨om⟩ deze tijd morgen zal ik ⟨את⟩ mijn dienaren naar jou sturen, en zij zullen ⟨את⟩ jouw huis doorzoeken en ⟨את⟩ de huizen van jouw dienaren; en het zal gebeuren: alles wat je ogen begeren, zullen zij in hun hand leggen en meenemen.'", "tokens": [{"surface": "כי", "gloss": "⟨maar⟩"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "⟨—⟩"}, {"surface": "כעת", "gloss": "om deze tijd"}, {"surface": "מחר", "gloss": "morgen"}, {"surface": "אשלח", "gloss": "zal ik sturen"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "mijn dienaren"}, {"surface": "עבדי", "gloss": "mijn dienaren"}, {"surface": "אליך", "gloss": "naar jou"}, {"surface": "וחפשו", "gloss": "en zij zullen doorzoeken"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "jouw huis"}, {"surface": "ביתך", "gloss": "jouw huis"}, {"surface": "ואת", "gloss": "en ⟨את⟩", "marks": "de huizen van jouw dienaren"}, {"surface": "בתי", "gloss": "de huizen"}, {"surface": "עבדיך", "gloss": "van jouw dienaren"}, {"surface": "והיה", "gloss": "en het zal gebeuren"}, {"surface": "כל", "gloss": "alles"}, {"surface": "מחמד", "gloss": "wat begerenswaardig is"}, {"surface": "עיניך", "gloss": "van jouw ogen"}, {"surface": "ישימו", "gloss": "zullen zij leggen"}, {"surface": "בידם", "gloss": "in hun hand"}, {"surface": "ולקחו", "gloss": "en meenemen"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-31T21:04:24.752681336Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}